  ],
  "description": "LINK-TXN with an own source: host with local table L and link LK to the source; in a Workspace transaction INSERT into LK and into L, counts read through the host and through an independent Database opened on the source; Rollback and the counts; a second transaction with Commit and the counts; a nested pair (inner commit, outer rollback) and the counts. Asks the source effect of rollback and commit for a link participant, as seen by an independent reader.",
